---
// Bench — hero.
---
<section id="bench" class="blueprint-grid relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pt-44 pb-24 md:pt-44 md:pb-32">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-14 md:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="md:col-span-7">
        <p
          class="reveal flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] text-ink-faint uppercase"
        >
          <span class="inline-block h-px w-10 bg-ink/30"></span>
          Station 01 &mdash; The Bench
        </p>

        <div class="reveal mt-7" style="--reveal-delay: 80ms">
          <span class="stamp text-marker">Software studio</span>
        </div>

        <h1
          class="reveal mt-8 font-display text-5xl leading-[1.04] font-medium tracking-tight text-ink md:text-7xl"
          style="--reveal-delay: 160ms"
        >
          Built
          <span class="relative inline-block px-1">
            by&nbsp;hand
            <svg
              class="absolute -inset-x-4 -inset-y-2 h-[calc(100%+16px)] w-[calc(100%+32px)]"
              viewBox="0 0 200 80"
              preserveAspectRatio="none"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <path
                d="M 139 14 C 160 16 178 22 187 31 C 195 39 193 48 187 53 C 175 62 155 66 139 70 C 118 74 90 75 68 71 C 45 67 22 62 16 55 C 10 48 8 38 13 31 C 20 22 40 16 61 14 C 72 13 82 11 92 11"
                fill="none"
                stroke="#c23a28"
                stroke-width="4.5"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                opacity="0.85"
              />
            </svg>
          </span>.<br />
          Shipped with <em class="font-light">care.</em>
        </h1>

        <p
          class="reveal mt-8 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft md:text-lg"
          style="--reveal-delay: 240ms"
        >
          Octopy is a software studio. We build web applications, server infrastructure,
          and open-source tools &mdash; designed, engineered, and maintained in-house.
          No assembly line.
        </p>

        <p
          class="reveal mt-6 -rotate-2 font-hand text-2xl text-pen"
          style="--reveal-delay: 300ms"
        >
          every pixel placed on purpose &mdash; S.
        </p>

        <div
          class="reveal mt-10 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row"
          style="--reveal-delay: 360ms"
        >
          <a
            href="#work"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 rounded-sm bg-ink px-7 py-3.5 font-mono text-sm text-paper transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
          >
            See what&rsquo;s on the bench
            <i class="ph ph-arrow-down text-base"></i>
          </a>
          <a
            href="#maker"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 rounded-sm border border-ink/25 px-7 py-3.5 font-mono text-sm text-ink transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-ink/60"
          >
            Meet the maker
          </a>
        </div>

        <p
          class="reveal mt-8 flex items-center gap-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-ink-faint"
          style="--reveal-delay: 420ms"
        >
          <span class="inline-block h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-marker"></span>
          Currently: guiding Poka Premium through Play Store review.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-5">
        <div
          class="reveal work-card relative rotate-1 p-7 transition-transform duration-500 hover:rotate-0 md:p-8"
          style="--reveal-delay: 280ms"
        >
          <div class="tape -top-3.5 left-10 -rotate-6"></div>
          <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] text-ink-faint uppercase">
            Shop rules
          </p>
          <ol class="mt-5 space-y-4">
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-sm text-marker">01</span>
              <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
                Disciplined scoping. We build what&rsquo;s needed &mdash; every feature earns
                its place.
              </p>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-sm text-marker">02</span>
              <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
                Single accountability. One team owns the application and the infrastructure
                beneath it.
              </p>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-sm text-marker">03</span>
              <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
                Built for production. Designed for uptime, monitored live, handed over
                documented.
              </p>
            </li>
          </ol>
          <p class="mt-6 rotate-1 font-hand text-xl text-ink-faint">
            pinned above the desk since day one
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
